# ADF435x core

Entry: [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) task-routing table.

- ADF4350/ADF4351 only
- `import adf435x` must not import `machine`
- `WORKED_WORDS[n]`=Rn; SPI/`commit_plan()` order R5→R0 (`reversed(WORKED_WORDS)`)
- `commit_plan()` retunes; `commit_all_plan()` power-up / divider boundary only
- Integer Hz in solver; `solve()` → fields → `configure()` — never encode in solver
- Validate at `configure()`; plan/mark in synthesizer (`mark_written` / `mark_write_failed`)
- DBR/DBB only in `register_file` (DBB from encoded R2)

Naming: [agent/GLOSSARY.md](agent/GLOSSARY.md) before new types/fields.
